dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log

# bench/ ships its harness (collector / aggregate / charts + a sanitised example),
# not the raw production evidence: that carries real node addresses, real ports,
# and named attribution of third-party hostile hosts, which rule 7 forbids. The
# unpublished parts are listed individually so `git add -A` cannot reach them.
# bench/README.md states what is published and why.
bench/report/
bench/USABILITY-REPORT.md
bench/data/telemetry.json
bench/_unpublished/
